 alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/AZV6lTm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Yc3s8na.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/iqjbhOr.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"36\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/sy21BTe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/4uSaqGJ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/AEX6ikk.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/hK2Ne4q.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/OofG9DM.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"36\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/u6uA7Yo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/wm2UCet.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Cw074li.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"36\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/2j5X6pZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/DXcKlJf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/vTsTyrz.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/mQgIVDu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/5xXqhXe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/kVHzJV9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/cYHSkb2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/GuGTe3L.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/pcmP0xG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/5EiwS3H.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"40\" /><br /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/UWFTH8U.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/xihe1Iq.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/mttOKJb.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1S9UjyX.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/8U6EqW7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/EY1Banv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"35\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/pRShE0c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ajOKaqG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/xyN0hmi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"34\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Merge Enchantments 是一款模組，讓你能夠混合或排除附魔，甚至將它們全部合併。一些範例包括&nbsp;鋒利、懲罰與節肢殺手、所有類型的保護（火焰、爆炸、彈射物）、絲綢之觸與效率、激流與引導／忠诚、密度、破甲、懲罰與節肢殺手。請查看 <a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Merge-Enchantments/wiki\">Wiki</a> 以了解設定檔的運作方式，你可以在其中建立 <a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Merge-Enchantments/wiki/Config#blacklist\">黑名單</a> 並 <a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Merge-Enchantments/wiki/Config#blacklist\">合併所有附魔</a>。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/H9nhuOr.gif\" width=\"414\" height=\"233\" />&nbsp;<img src=\"https://imgur.com/l717aDK.gif\" width=\"414\" height=\"234\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"34\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>常見問題</strong></span></em></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>問：它能與其他模組的附魔一起使用嗎？</strong></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">答：自 3.0 版本起，即可合併所有原版與外部模組的附魔。</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>問：我該如何同時獲得<span style=\"color: #008000;\">絲綢之觸</span>與<span style=\"color: #99cc00;\">效率</span>？</strong><br />答：你需要安裝 Merge Enchantments 以及 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toggle-enchantments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Toggle Enchantments<br /></span><strong>問：我該如何將<span style=\"color: #3366ff;\">激流</span>與<span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">忠诚</span>及<span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\">引導</span>合併？</strong><br />答：你需要安裝 Merge Enchantments 以及 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/improved-trident-enchantments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Improved Trident Enchantments</a></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>問：我可以將 Merge Enchantments 加入我的模組包中嗎？</strong></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">答：當然可以，只需在相關專案中提及我的模組即可。</span></li>\n</ul>",
